      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing AssemblyAI as Provider**\n\nI've decided to use AssemblyAI as the external provider for speaker diarization. My immediate next step is to make this explicit within the `diarized_transcript.py` script. The code needs to clearly reference AssemblyAI to ensure the process can run correctly.\n\n\n**Implementing AssemblyAI Diarization**\n\nI'm now creating the `diarized_transcript.py` file. I'm importing the AssemblyAI SDK and will use an environment variable for the API key. The code will specify an audio file path (placeholder for now), configure diarization within the transcription request, and then print the result. I'm assuming AssemblyAI is installed; otherwise, I'll instruct the user to install it.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819853958,
          "start": 1789819851764
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
